{"4991510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rolling Free", "steam_appid": 4991510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4996650], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 3D physics platformer is built around fluid feel and precise controls, finely crafted for platforming enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of a hamster ball equipped with a grappling hook. Swing through handcrafted levels, build momentum off slopes, and nail precision jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core physics system has been rigorously tuned to deliver snappy, predictable and fair feedback — with zero input lag to break your gameplay rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for all fans of precision platforming, physics-driven gameplay, and fast-paced speedrun challenges.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 3D physics platformer is built around fluid feel and precise controls, finely crafted for platforming enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of a hamster ball equipped with a grappling hook. Swing through handcrafted levels, build momentum off slopes, and nail precision jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core physics system has been rigorously tuned to deliver snappy, predictable and fair feedback — with zero input lag to break your gameplay rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for all fans of precision platforming, physics-driven gameplay, and fast-paced speedrun challenges.</p>", "short_description": "A grapple-physics 3D platformer. You're a hamster tired of the wheel—so you flee upward, from cage to an antenna that leads to the moon. Swing, accelerate, nail your landings; when you fall, start over. The higher you climb, the heavier it gets. A narrator whispers: giving up is fine, too.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https:/